        <reimplements refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1FunctionObjectIO_1a2a135997dc8957415c3077e11b22557c">execute</reimplements>
        <reimplementedby refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1ForceCoeffs_1ae7a9c66f7f457bfb2fd3c775877fa5d9">execute</reimplementedby>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Run the GPU force-integral computation. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Looks up the <computeroutput>NeoN::Database</computeroutput> via the <computeroutput><ref refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1DatabaseWrapper" kindref="compound">DatabaseWrapper</ref></computeroutput> registered in the <computeroutput>Foam::Time</computeroutput> objectRegistry, then finds the pressure field <computeroutput>pName_</computeroutput> in the <computeroutput>VectorCollection</computeroutput>. The field must have been registered by the solver (e.g. via <computeroutput><ref refid="namespaceNeoFOAM_1a48fbbbb3755e34d928cf0d189532d93c" kindref="member">NeoFOAM::constructAndRegister</ref></computeroutput>) before the first <computeroutput><ref refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1Forces_1ad9ae38e7170e3b4a121fb1a0a46d5e2e" kindref="member">execute()</ref></computeroutput> call. Accumulates pressure forces and moments for each registered patch via a GPU-parallel kernel; results are stored in <ref refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1Forces_1a51ad0e649eabe29078bf8ff6e20324a7" kindref="member">lastResult()</ref>. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="/home/runner/work/NeoFOAM/NeoFOAM/include/NeoFOAM/functionObjects/forces.hpp" line="100" column="18"/>
      </memberdef>
