        <briefdescription>
<para>GPU kernel: accumulate pressure force/moment for one boundary patch. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Runs <computeroutput>parallelFor</computeroutput> over faces in the patch range and uses <computeroutput>NeoN::atomic_add</computeroutput> into a 6-element device accumulator. Transfers 6 scalars to host on completion.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
